# Generated datasets (regenerated artifacts, not source). These sit under TrajGen/sample
# only for historical reasons and are re-ignored AFTER the negation above (last match wins),
# so they stop showing up as untracked/committable. Prefer generating out-of-tree:
#   gen_dataset.sh <gpu> ~/kevin/datasets_shared/<name> <ids...>
TrajGen/sample/Holosoma_*/
TrajGen/sample/Sonic_native_probe*/

